            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'This visual outlines the percentage of referrals where there is a referral goal. Note: any referral goal that is not linked to a person centred goal, will not show here.  In turn, the person centred goal MUST be linked to a referral in  your service.  These visuals are already prefiltered to whaiora who have been in the service for MORE THAN 28 DAYS.  From July 2026, this page now reports only referrals accepted on or after 1 June 2024.'"
